# Docker Conventions

- Every service: Dockerfile, healthcheck, structured logging, env-based config
- Compose for development; Stack for Swarm production
- Prefer internal networks for data stores; expose via Traefik when public
- Never bake secrets into images; use env/secrets
- Image tags must be reproducible (pin versions for infra images)
- Validate compose/stack in CI when changing `docker/`
